Subject: [PATCH 2048/3799] soh: rename func_80AB6F04 -> EnNiw_Swim

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the water state: cancels gravity, rides the surface spawning ripples, and bounces off walls
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Niw/z_en_niw.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Niw/z_en_niw.c | 7 ++++---
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Niw/z_en_niw.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Niw/z_en_niw.c
index b71c87eef..97677630b 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Niw/z_en_niw.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Niw/z_en_niw.c
@@ -724,7 +724,8 @@ void EnNiw_FlyAway(EnNiw* this, PlayState* play) {
     EnNiw_AnimateLimbs(this, play, 2);  // was func_80AB5BF8 [LLM:HIGH]
 }
 
-void func_80AB6F04(EnNiw* this, PlayState* play) {
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_80AB6F04: the water state: cancels gravity, rides the surface spawning ripples, and bounces off walls
+void EnNiw_Swim(EnNiw* this, PlayState* play) {
     Vec3f pos;
 
     if (this->unk_2A8 != 0) {
@@ -1050,7 +1051,7 @@ void EnNiw_Update(Actor* thisx, PlayState* play) {
         return;
     }
 
-    if (thisx->bgCheckFlags & 0x20 && thisx->yDistToWater > 15.0f && this->actionFunc != func_80AB6F04 &&
